    "sources": [
      {
        "type": "manual",
        "title": "M.Brane 11 Operating Manual",
        "notes": "The MIDI implementation's controller tables (PDF pages 25 - 27), read by tools/profiles/jomox/read-jomox-cc.mjs from MBrane11_E.pdf (sha256 967e4dcb252ebed525c18e0d975ce75d7a6c487314d38dd53479b1c634b028ac), https://www.jomox.de/upload/manuals/MBrane11_E.pdf, linked from https://www.jomox.de/support.php?lang=2&product_id=13. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
      }
    ],
    "testedWith": [],
    "authoringNotes": [
      "Generated by tools/profiles/jomox/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/jomox/synths/, not this file.",
      "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI implementation, sent as the controller it prints, on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
      "A value range named one each by the internal range beside it (`0/64  Off/On`) is a choice; values printed without names are a choice of those values; every other range is a number, its internal range or resolution in its description.",
      "MSB and LSB rows sent as one value over both controllers, the MSB first: M1 Pitch (CC 90 and 91, 0 - 255); M1 Dampen (CC 92 and 93, 0 - 255); M2 Pitch (CC 94 and 95, 0 - 255); M2 Dampen (CC 96 and 97, 0 - 255); M1_2 Couplg (CC 100 and 101, 0 - 255); M2_1 Couplg (CC 102 and 103, 0 - 255); Metal Noise A (CC 106 and 107, 0 - 255); Metal Noise B (CC 115 and 116, 0 - 255).",
      "Left out, actions: Store Preset (CC 62, 0/64)."
    ],
